<title>CANADA: CanOxy sets C$100 mln debenture issue.</title>
<headline>CanOxy sets C$100 mln debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd said on Thursday it would issue C$100 million principal ammount of debentures.</p>
<p>CanOxy said the debentures would carry a coupon of 6.85 percent and mature on November 15, 2006.</p>
<p>The proceeds from the issue would be used to repay short-term debt, it said.</p>
<p>An underwriting group led by RBC Dominion Securities Inc and including TD Securities Inc and CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Inc, agreed to buy the debentures, CanOxy said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
